{"title":"🍂 Thanksgiving International Potluck 🥧","startsAt":"2026-10-12T13:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-12T15:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"You're invited to our Thanksgiving International Potluck! Join us for an afternoon of great food, wonderful company, and community. Let's celebrate gratitude together by sharing our favorite dishes from around the world.\n\nWhether you're bringing a traditional family recipe or a new favorite, we can't wait to share a meal with you.\n\n📅 Date: Saturday, October 12\n⏰ Time: 1:30 PM - 3:30 PM\n📍 Location: 879 St Clair Ave W\n\n🍽️ What to Bring:\nPlease bring a dish to share! To make sure we have a balanced meal, please mention in the comments what you plan to bring (appetizer, main, side, or dessert) so we can coordinate.\n\nCome hungry and ready to make new friends. RSVP today so we know how many to expect. See you there!","venue":{"name":"879 St Clair Ave W","address":"879 St Clair Ave W, Toronto","lat":43.679947,"lng":-79.43334,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Catholic Hang-out / Social Group","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/0/b/f/highres_536377055.jpeg"}